{"assets":["/statement-assets/2602795e97b51852e9b29828341228c6b8afc7ab3b02beef8ca764b4fa80d804.png"],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"2074","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A. Draw a Square"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The pink soldiers have given you $$$4$$$ "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"distinct points"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" on the plane. The $$$4$$$ points' coordinates are $$$(-l,0)$$$, $$$(r,0)$$$, $$$(0,-d)$$$, $$$(0,u)$$$ correspondingly, where $$$l$$$, $$$r$$$, $$$d$$$, $$$u$$$ are positive integers."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/2602795e97b51852e9b29828341228c6b8afc7ab3b02beef8ca764b4fa80d804.png"},"kind":"image"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the diagram, a square is drawn by connecting the four points $$$L$$$, $$$R$$$, $$$D$$$, $$$U$$$."}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"container"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Please determine if it is possible to draw a square$$$^{\\text{∗}}$$$ with the given points as its vertices."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$^{\\text{∗}}$$$A "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"square"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" is defined as a polygon consisting of $$$4$$$ vertices, of which all sides have equal length and all inner angles are equal. No two edges of the polygon may intersect each other."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Each test contains multiple test cases. The first line contains the number of test cases $$$t$$$ ($$$1 \\le t \\le 10^4$$$). The description of the test cases follows. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of each test case contains four integers $$$l$$$, $$$r$$$, $$$d$$$, $$$u$$$ ($$$1 \\le l,r,d,u \\le 10$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each test case, if you can draw a square using the four points, output \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Yes"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\". Otherwise, output \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"No"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You can output the answer in any case. For example, the strings \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"yEs"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"yes"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", and \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"YES"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" will also be recognized as positive responses."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n2\n2 2 2 2\n1 2 3 4\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\nYes\nNo\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"On the first test case, the four given points form a square, so the answer is \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Yes"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"On the second test case, the four given points do not form a square, so the answer is \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"No"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"A","problemCode":"2074A","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/2074/problem/A"}